              "For his part, Xi too said, \"I am ready to meet with the President (Trump) during the G-20 Osaka Summit to exchange views on fundamental issues concerning the development of China-US relations,\" an official statement here said after the telephonic conversation between the two leaders. Xi stressed that on economic and trade issues, the two sides should solve their problems through dialogue on an equal footing, with the key being to accommodate each other's reasonable concerns",
